      "text": "WTHFLFB2B - 11/25\nNotes for tonight\nBreak 389\n• we ran boxes on the wheel\n• I labeled each overflow sheet with buyers name and box number\n• I put them in the same bin to avoid influx of bins\n• Picture above\nBreak: 395\n• dual auto was hit by Spencer8185 and Swingmansports\n• the dual Jordyn Tyson and Carnell Tate dual tye dye auto /2\n• They agreed to consign the card split the profit\n• Labeled in spreadsheet and picture above",
